{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13714","headline":"长安窦明府後亭 · 顾况","name":"长安窦明府後亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君爲长安令，我美长安政。\n五日一朝天，南山对明镜。\n鸟飞青苔院，水木相辉映。\n客至南云乡，丝桐展歌咏。\n吏人何萧萧，终岁无喧竞。\n欲识明府贤，邑中多百姓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}